# Default: normalise line endings in the repository, native in the working copy.
* text=auto

# iCalendar requires CRLF line endings (RFC 5545), so keep these files exactly
# as written - no normalisation on commit or checkout. (Later rules win here,
# so these have to come after the catch-all above.)
*.ics -text

# Binary formats git should not touch or try to diff as text.
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
